ory must have before it is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"delivered; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":", every event delivered, by default."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"enrichers","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"What each event’s context gains, applied in order by the tracker’s worker.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"samplers","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Which events, or groups of events, to keep a fraction of, decided by the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracker’s worker after the enrichers; none by default, so every event is kept.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"samplingSeed","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The seed the samplers’ decisions come from: fix it and which events are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"kept is fixed too. Drawn from the system’s random number generator once, as the tracker"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is made, by default. Fix it only in tests and replays: every launch with the same seed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"makes the same decision for its first matching event, its second and so on, so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fixed seed shipped to every device keeps the same events everywhere rather than the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sampler’s rate of them."}]}]},{"name":"now","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The wall-clock time each event is stamped with when it is tracked. It runs on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracking caller’s thread, so keep it fast."}]}]}]}],"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers":{"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"type":"topic","title":"Trackers","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","url":"\/documentation\/trackers"},"doc://Trackers/do